        "     Add 2/3 Remote: ↑/↓ recent, digits for Other, Enter next\\n\\",
        "     Add 3/3 Local: ↑/↓ choice, digits for manual, Enter start\\n\\",
        "     Esc goes back one stage; from Host it cancels.\"",
        "}"
